# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value. .env.local is git-ignored.
#
# Groq API key for the plain-language rule assistant (POST /api/parse-rule).
# Create one at https://console.groq.com/keys on the Free plan.
#
# - Server-side only: read by the Vite dev route (npm run dev) and the Vercel
#   function. Never prefix it with VITE_, or it would be bundled into the browser.
# - Optional: without it, CSV upload and pricing work normally and the rule
#   assistant reports that it is not set up.
# - On Vercel, add it under Project Settings -> Environment Variables (mark it sensitive).
GROQ_API_KEY=
